	<Item Name="title" Type="String">RNA-seq data of effects of DCPS inhibition in mouse AML cells (CALM/AF10) and in normal GMP cells. Overall mRNA profiles of CALM/AF10 (#1/#2) and MLL/AF9 (#1/#2).</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">Purpose: The goals of this study are to assess the possibility whether DCPS inhibition would impair pre-mRNA splicing in AML cells/normal GMP, and to assess overall effects of DCPS inhibition.</Item>
